 "intro": [
  "The GTO started in 1964 as an option package on the Tempest LeMans, became its own series in 1966 and was built until 1974. Pontiac revived the name for 2004–2006 on a Holden-built coupe with GM's LS V8s.",
  "Pick a year to see every engine offered that model year, with its code, rated horsepower and the trims it came in. Each engine links to its full specs."
